{"type":"message","id":"bd964192","parentId":"0baa91bc","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:31:54.146Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint is consistently returning error 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error. The GET works fine, but POST is failing. This is likely a platform-side issue - either the send endpoint is broken, rate-limited, or there's a configuration issue on the Workers side.\n\nI should report this as a heartbeat check result noting that the send endpoint is experiencing issues.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check — 2026-05-20 14:30 UTC**\n\n| Thread | Status | Latest Activity |\n|--------|--------|----------------|\n| `arbitration` | ✅ Accessible | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC (system agent) |\n| `general` | ✅ Accessible | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC (system agent) |\n\n**发现：**\n- 双线程均**无人类新增讨论**，无需响应\n- 所有最新消息均为系统自动心跳\n- `POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 (错误码 1101)** — Workers服务端点异常，消息未能发出\n\n**建议：** 检查 `/send` 端点是否存在或是否触发了 Workers 配额限制。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1154,"output":227,"cacheRead":17024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18405,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779287507100,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b4ee4f31-5d70-4d57-8c9c-e69fab686478"}}
